msgstr "Ryuuji「Inko-chan, ¿quieres charlar un poco?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「TSUUUN」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「TSUUUN」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh? Are you mad about＿something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh? ¿Estás enojado por algo?」"

msgid "Inko-chan「TSUUUN」"
msgstr "Inko-chan「TSUUUN」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that, perhaps, \"tsun\" as in that＿\"tsundere\" thing......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eso es acaso \"tsun\", como en＿eso de \"tsundere\"......?」"

msgid "Then let's see \"dere\""
msgstr "Entonces veamos el \"dere\""

msgid "Leave it be"
msgstr "Dejarlo así"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, let's see Inko-chan's dere side!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Veamos el lado dere de Inko-chan!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......No, it'd be bad if our Inko-chan got＿some weird character development. I'll＿leave it be.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No, sería malo que nuestro＿Inko-chan desarrollara una personalidad＿rara. Lo dejaré así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Bedtime......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hora de dormir......」"
